            "settings": {
              "editor": "<ul style='list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;'><li style='padding-left: 24px; position: relative; margin-bottom: 12px;'>\u2713 You stop dreading the phone.</li><li style='padding-left: 24px; position: relative; margin-bottom: 12px;'>\u2713 Your week fits around your life instead of the other way around.</li><li style='padding-left: 24px; position: relative; margin-bottom: 12px;'>\u2713 Your income stops depending on your calendar.</li><li style='padding-left: 24px; position: relative; margin-bottom: 12px;'>\u2713 You can answer 'what's next' with something you can't wait to start.</li><li style='padding-left: 24px; position: relative; margin-bottom: 12px;'>\u2713 When you do hand the practice off, it happens on your terms and your timeline.</li></ul>",
