              "editor": "<ul style='list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;'><li style='padding-left: 24px; position: relative; margin-bottom: 12px;'>\u2717 Keep white-knuckling toward a retirement date that keeps moving.</li><li style='padding-left: 24px; position: relative; margin-bottom: 12px;'>\u2717 Let the practice keep eating evenings and weekends.</li><li style='padding-left: 24px; position: relative; margin-bottom: 12px;'>\u2717 Sell in a hurry to whoever shows up with a check.</li><li style='padding-left: 24px; position: relative; margin-bottom: 12px;'>\u2717 Keep hating it quietly while everyone keeps congratulating you.</li></ul>",
